# Never ship host-built artifacts or secrets into a build context.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.turbo
coverage
**/coverage

.git
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.production
.whatsapp-auth
packages/database/*.cjs

android
*.apk
# `data` on its own matches only /data at the context root — it does NOT match
# apps/api/data, so the captive-portal configs written there at runtime were being
# baked into the image by `COPY . .` and then restored over the live ones on every
# deploy. The `**/` prefix is what makes this match at any depth.
**/data
scratch
docs
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo

# ...but the customer app download served by the web app must ship.
!apps/web/public/download/*.apk

# The Sanity Studio is deployed to sanity.studio, never built into an image.
studio
